        <generalfeedback format="html">
            <text><![CDATA[
<p>
    <span class="multilang" lang="en">
        We are given the cubic \[{@eqn@} = {@(x - root)*(a*x^2 + b*x + c)@}.\] If we expand the RHS we obtain \[{@eqn@} = {@expand((x - root)*(a*x^2 + b*x + c))@}.\] Collecting like-terms we get
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="no">
        Vi har fått det kubiske uttrykket \[{@eqn@} = {@(x - root)*(a*x^2 + b*x + c)@}.\] Hvis vi utvider høyre side får vi \[{@ eqn@} = {@expand((x - root)*(a*x^2 + b*x + c))@}.\] Ved å samle like-termer får vi
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="de">
        Wir erhalten die qubische Gleichung \[{@eqn@} = {@(x - root)*(a*x^2 + b*x + c)@} .\] Wenn wir die rechte Seite erweitern, erhalten wir \[{@eqn@} = {@expand((x - root)*(a*x^2 + b*x + c))@}.\] Durch das Zusammenfassen gleichartiger Terme erhalten wir
    </span>
    \[{@eqn@}
                = {@ta1*x^3 + ta2*x^2 + ta3*x + ta4@}.\]
</p>
<p>
    <span class="multilang" lang="en">
        If we equate the coefficients of the LHS and RHS of the above equation, we obtain \(a = 1\), \(b = {@-2*aa@}\) and \(c={@aa^2-bb@}\).
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="no">
        Hvis vi setter likhetstegn mellom koeffisientene på høyre og venstre side i ligningen ovenfor, får vi \(a = 1\), \(b = {@-2*aa@}\) og \(c={@aa^2- bb@}\).
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="de">
        Wenn wir die Koeffizienten der linken und rechten Seite der obigen Gleichung gleichsetzen, erhalten wir \(a = 1\), \(b = {@-2*aa@} \) und \(c={@aa^2-bb@}\).
    </span>
</p>
<p>
    <span class="multilang" lang="en">
        This enables us to write the equation as \({@(x-root)*quad=0@}\) so \({@x-root=0@}\) or \({@quad@}=0\).
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="no">
        Dette gjør oss i stand til å skrive ligningen som \({@(x-root)*quad=0@}\) så \({@x-root=0@}\) eller \({@quad@}=0\).
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="de">
        Dies ermöglicht es uns, die Gleichung als \({@(x-root)*quad=0@}\) zu schreiben, also gilt \({@x-root=0@} \) oder \({@quad@}=0\).
    </span>
</p>
<p>
    <span class="multilang" lang="en">
        The quadratic equation can be solved using the quadratic formula to obtain \(x={@x2@}\) and \(x={@x3@}\).
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="no">
        Andregradsuttrykket kan løses ved å bruke abc-formelen og få \(x={@x2@}\) og \(x={@x3@}\).
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="de">
        Die quadratische Gleichung kann mit der quadratischen Formel gelöst werden, um \(x={@x2@}\) und \(x={@x3@}\) zu erhalten.
    </span>
</p>
<p>
    <span class="multilang" lang="en">
        Thus the three roots of \({@eqn=0@}\) are \(x={@x1@}\), \(x={@x2@}\), and \(x={@x3@}.\)
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="no">
        Dermed er de tre røttene til \({@eqn=0@}\): \(x={@x1@}\), \(x={@x2@}\), og \(x={@x3@}.\)
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="de">
        Die drei Nullstellen von \({@eqn=0@}\) sind also \(x={@x1@}\), \(x={@x2@}\) und \(x={@x3@}.\)
    </span>
</p>
]]></text>
